ontent": "Quel verbe choisissez-vous pour demander poliment quelque chose \u00e0 quelqu'un ?", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}, {"content": "secondary_2", "type": "objective"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 1, "id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "Pouvoir", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": 0, "id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "\u00c9crire", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": 0, "id": 2, "text": "", "_data": [{"content": "S'appeler", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}]}, {"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Quel signe de ponctuation employez-vous \u00e0 la fin d'une demande ?", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}, {"content": "secondary_2", "type": "objective"}], "id": 1, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "!", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "?", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": 0, "id": 2, "text": "", "_data": [{"content": ":", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}]}, {"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Fran\u00e7oise commande trois petits pains au chocolat. Qu'est-ce que le p\u00e2tissier r\u00e9pond \u00e0 Fran\u00e7oise ?", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}, {"content": "secondary_2", "type": "objective"}], "id": 2, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "Il n'y en a pas.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": 0, "id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "Pardonnez-moi.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "id": 2, "text": "", "_data": [{"content": "D\u00e9sol\u00e9, mademoiselle, il n'y a plus de petits pains au chocolat.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}]}]}, {"id": 3, "stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Entra\u00eenons-nous \u00e0 pratiquer les signes de ponctuation !</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\" italic \">Consignes :</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"bullet\"> Lisez chaque phrase.